# Line-ending normalisation policy
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# Default
#
# Git detects which files are text and stores every one of them with LF in the
# repository, then checks them out with LF as well. The committed form no longer
# depends on the contributor's core.autocrlf setting, so a one-line source edit
# produces a one-line diff instead of a whole-file diff.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
#
# Declared explicitly rather than left to content detection, so images and fonts
# are never eligible for text or line-ending conversion.

*.avif  binary
*.ico   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff2 binary
